  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Heavyweight T-Shirts are designed with comfort and longevity in mind. The durable and heavy-duty cotton / polyester fabric blend easily withstands consistent or rigorous use. From a hard day of work, to a causal night around the campfire, these rugged t-shirts remain soft and comfortable. These dependable shirts are perfect for field work, outdoor adventures, casual everyday use, professional workwear, and more!</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133327",
  "description": "<p>Our Heavyweight T-Shirts are designed with comfort and longevity in mind. The durable and heavy-duty cotton / polyester fabric blend easily withstands consistent or rigorous use. From a hard day of work, to a causal night around the campfire, these rugged t-shirts remain soft and comfortable. These dependable shirts are perfect for field work, outdoor adventures, casual everyday use, professional workwear, and more! Great for Layering: Looking for a high-performing base layer shirt? The heavy-duty tee is perfect for either wearing on its own or as an undershirt. The heavyweight 6.75 oz. fabric provides additional warmth, which is especially useful when you&rsquo;re out in the field. Action Ready: These crewneck t-shirts feature reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem to further enhance the shirt&rsquo;s durability. With a tag-less neck label, you&rsquo;re free to move around without any itches or scratches. Standard Fit: These heavyweight tees are standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for various activities, especially around the arms. Our t-shirts sit approximately at the waist for full coverage. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Layer up with one of our Buffalo Plaid Flannel Shirts, Thermal Lined Hooded Sweatshirts, or MA-1 Flight Jackets!</p>",
